     A                                  4  2'-----------------------------------
     A                                      ----------------------------------'
     A                                  5  2'Date'
     A                                  5 15'Time'
     A                                  5 25'Type'
     A                                  5 32'Amount'
     A                                  5 48'Balance'
     A* Output arrays in RPG but explicitly defined rows in DDS for performance
     A            DT1           10A  O  7  2
     A            TM1            8A  O  7 15
     A            TY1            2A  O  7 25
     A            AM1           15A  O  7 32
     A            BL1           15Y 2O  7 48EDTCDE(4)
